// =====================================================================
//  BALANCE + ABILITY LAYER — loaded after every arena file.
//  Why: a duel simulator (tools/duel.js) showed most arenas had no answer to their tanks and
//  tower-chasers (no ramping damage, no heavy single-target hitter, buildings that did nothing),
//  while a handful of cards beat almost everything. This file gives each arena a full counter web,
//  every building a real job, and every plain troop a trait that fits who they are.
//  Stats are then tuned by data_tune.js (generated by tools/tune.js from the duel results).
// =====================================================================
